  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive)</p>\n<p><strong>Mods:</strong> Belt-Box and Drum Magazine Attachments, and Pistols which cannot accept capacity modifying attachments</p>\n<p><em>Redesigns large-scale magazines to fit more dakka options per iron.</em></p>\n<p>The weapon’s magazine can load up to three different types of ammunition (which the weapon is already compatible with), with the user choosing which to use when firing the weapon. If the weapon already has a magazine that can load multiple ammo types, this mod stacks onto the limit of possible simultaneous loaded types. For firing modes which expend multiple rounds, all expended ammunition must be of the same type for it to function.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0 (Weapon Mod)</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Mod Catalog &gt; Attachment Mods).</em></p>"
